    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "My question, I'll start off by talking about something that you recently told the New York Times. You said, quote, our hearings have demonstrated the essential culpability of Donald Trump, and we will complete that story. Could you tell our listeners in a nutshell what you think the crux of that story is? Why is Donald Trump culpable for the insurrection?",
