    "turn_text": "I don't want to or need to make any kind of judgment about that. She she has adopted a cultish way of thinking she actually was in a religious cult and has spoken about that and about what it meant to get out and to be deprogrammed and I hope she can essentially go through the exact same experience getting out of the cult of Donald Trump. And there is a book by that name. I think it's called the Cult of Trump",
