    "turn_text": "Congressman, we have upcoming guests on the show Karun Demirigian and Rachel Bade who have just written a book that's going to be released in the next week or so on the Impeachments. And you obviously were very, very close to the second impeachment, especially. Looking back, do you wish that the Democrats had done anything different in either impeachment?",
